            "review_title": "Review at Phan Thiet Quan",
            "review_text": "jaszb\nPerth, Australia20 contributions\n0\nOutstanding food! A gem in Saigon.\nApr 2014\nWe ate here today and are so pleased we did. The food was outstanding, the service was remarkable- we felt so welcome by everyone. We had 4 different types of dishes; beautiful clam and lemongrass broth, a barbecued squid, a fried rice and seafood dish (the BEST rice dish we have had in Vietnam) and a grilled cuttlefish and octopus dish. Every single dish was different, bursting with freshness and complex flavors. Our two boys loved the food here and filled themselves up with a wonderful meal. The beer was icy cold which was an added bonus! This really is a hidden gem and deserves to be up there with the best food restaurants in Saigon.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 25, 2014",
